@startuml
title F14 - Opt-in daily morning summary
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
control "Daily scheduler" as Scheduler
boundary "A03\nApp routines" as A03
control "B07\nRead models/API" as B07
control "B05\nNotification routing" as B05
participant "Web Push provider" as Push
boundary "A02\nApp home" as A02
actor "Primary caregiver" as Caregiver
Caregiver -> A03: Enable one daily summary and select delivery route
A03 -> B05: Persist explicit opt-in and schedule key
Scheduler -> B05: Trigger home/day summary job
B05 -> B07: Read morning evidence, modes, coverage and unresolved incidents
B07 --> B05: Return coverage-honest projection
B05 -> B05: Deduplicate by home/day and build fixed summary
B05 -> Push: Submit one advisory summary
Push -> Caregiver: Deliver summary
Caregiver -> A02: Open detailed evidence timeline
note over B05,A02: A summary never resolves an incident and never converts missing evidence into a safety statement.
note over Scheduler,Caregiver: Outcome - One opt-in summary presents evidence and coverage honestly without creating or closing an incident.
@enduml
